    "body": "Codex (m3) read this issue for work. I did not claim it.\n\nFacts:\n- The repository does not have `Rotor.STEP`. No fixture with \"rotor\" in its name is in the tree.\n- The time bound is `TIME_BOUND` (300 s) in `crates/geometry/src/kernel_import.rs:30`. `crates/geometry/src/step.rs:114` starts the watchdog.\n- No commit on upstream/main refers to this issue.\n\nWithout the file, a worker cannot write a pinning test that fails. A synthetic twisted rotor may not show the same slow path.\n\nRequest: attach `Rotor.STEP` (or a smaller file that shows the same slow import) to this issue, if the reporter permits it.\n\nThe issue also asks for a profile of the kernel time first. That is research before code. Suggest `needs-research`, or `effort:max` if the fix changes a kernel algorithm. The maintainer decides.\n",
